---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | DumpsterGrid" 
  description="Privacy Policy and data processing terms for DumpsterGrid. Learn how we handle project quotes, user consent, and waste hauler routing compliance."
>
  <section class="relative py-24 px-6 overflow-hidden min-h-[80vh] flex items-center">
    
    <!-- Ambient Glows -->
    <div class="ambient-glow-amber w-[400px] h-[400px] -top-10 -left-10 animate-pulse-slow"></div>
    <div class="ambient-glow-blue w-[400px] h-[400px] -bottom-10 -right-10 animate-pulse-slow"></div>
    
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full relative z-10 space-y-8">
      
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="text-center space-y-3">
        <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-500/10 border border-brand-500/25 text-brand-600 font-display font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
          📋 Compliance Documents
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">
          Last Updated: May 29, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Legal Body (Obsidian Glass Card) -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-slate-200 shadow-xl">
        
        <p class="text-base text-slate-800 font-medium">
          At DumpsterGrid, we take your personal privacy seriously. This policy describes how we collect, store, route, and protect data provided when you interact with our localized quote match wizards.
        </p>

        <hr class="border-slate-100" />

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">1. Information We Collect</h3>
          <p>
            When utilizing our quote matching wizard, we collect specific details required to fulfill waste management coordination services. This includes:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-500">
            <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Your full name, telephone phone number, and email address.</li>
            <li><strong>Project Specs:</strong> Waste type classifications, delivery zip codes, and dumpster size capacities (10-Yard, 20-Yard, 30-Yard, or 40-Yard).</li>
            <li><strong>Digital Anchors:</strong> IP addresses, browser dimensions, and referral sources captured for optimization.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">2. How We Use and Share Information</h3>
          <p>
            DumpsterGrid operates as an informational directory and referral middleware network. We use your data to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-500">
            <li>Match your project specs with verified independent local hauling contractors in your county.</li>
            <li>Route dispatch calls and text messages regarding pricing quotes directly to your contact endpoints.</li>
            <li>Optimize site speeds, localized layouts, and database relations.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We <strong>never sell or lease</strong> your contact information to unsolicited third-party advertising companies. Your details are only shared with matching waste haulers or broker networks to complete your requested quote.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">3. Consent for Communications</h3>
          <p>
            By submitting your contact coordinates on our quote wizard, you provide express written consent to receive telephone dispatch communications, email estimates, or system alert text messages regarding pricing and drop-off instructions. No promotional spam campaigns are authorized under this service.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">4. Data Security</h3>
          <p>
            All submitted payloads are encrypted during transmission using Standard SSL layers. We store captured leads inside secured serverless vaults and destroy records after fulfillment pipelines close to protect against data leakage.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">5. Contact and Opt-Outs</h3>
          <p>
            If you wish to request the deletion of your personal records or revoke routing consent, please email us directly or call our national dispatch center at <strong>1-800-508-4000</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
